Cell["Optional Momentum Comparison", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"bf5e6e57-d5f0-495c-b377-df6d270fbf49"],

Cell["\<\
Run this section only when you want a cross-check against the momentum \
calculation. Do not use it to produce coordinate-space paper-final numbers.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"10b3973b-90b9-4b38-8912-a5dc9f8e116c"],

